{"title":"Return Of The All-Time Genius Ranker","synopsis":"Sebuah game virtual reality yang menelan dunia, God of Savior.\n\nDan game yang menjadi fondasinya—Deus Ex Machina: Ragnarok, yang biasa disebut Demrock.\n\nDi puncaknya berdiri Kaiser, ranker tak tertandingi yang memegang posisi #1 mutlak.\n\nDulu dipuja layaknya dewa, ia menghilang karena keadaan yang tak terhindarkan…\n\nKini, setelah 1 tahun 6 bulan. Dia telah kembali.\n\n“Apakah kamu ingin login?”","alternative_title":"The Return of the Unrivaled Genius Ranker, 역대급 천재 랭커의 귀환","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","genres":["Action","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"c8e8de7d-b3dc-4885-9aa4-c22803bbcbc3","number":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-07-30","images":[]},{"id":"b4a2ef89-8386-443a-be3b-43cc5b4c6282","number":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-07-23","images":[]},{"id":"eba5c00e-ca66-47e8-a287-52411abdfff2","number":"33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-07-16","images":[]},{"id":"3a14418a-bb6c-484f-9d9d-0f0d477fccc3","number":"32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"8c62f98b-0e19-4ced-a6c8-61bfdeb499f3","number":"31","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-07-02","images":[]},{"id":"1d2be982-1a2c-4da4-9762-7bbc3f1a780f","number":"30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"5228fb26-2af5-4950-9878-ef922ee81dac","number":"29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-06-18","images":[]},{"id":"a0ad1a5b-98c7-4cd8-9f83-ddb5ccaf8147","number":"28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"id":"182a3d6f-2ead-42be-b6a5-3ab234d4b41a","number":"27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"id":"da5a02c0-5a8b-44e9-aa7e-8bec35a92ce0","number":"26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-05-29","images":[]},{"id":"8813b480-c237-4dcc-8143-f0a627ba3272","number":"25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-05-22","images":[]},{"id":"f91cf218-7050-4e8c-bc81-7d262c8c45f6","number":"24","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-05-15","images":[]},{"id":"b91a302b-